00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.241
It really is unbelievable

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:11.011
to see an unbelievable blue dangerous.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:11.945
You're about to see a view

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:13.947
inside the brutal, complicated,

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:14.781
and I should add,

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:17.183
ingenious battle against Russia.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:18.685
Here's Fred Pleitgen.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.787
Incredible report

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:22.989
today printed in a 3D printed

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:24.457
stabilizer fin,

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:25.825
some plumbing, tubing,

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:28.361
lots of glue, and the bomb is ready

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.698
Then it's night vision goggles on,

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:32.932
lights off

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.068
and full speed ahead to the front line.

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:41.508
We're with an elite drone

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.410
unit of Ukraine's security service,

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:44.077
the FSB.

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:45.979
You and the patrol police

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:47.280
looking to take out a key

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.149
Russian anti-tank position

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:50.884
with a precision strike.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.352
Moises Naim, what's your position?

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.120
We found this target only recently.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.122
A team leader says it was discovered

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.991
literally today and today

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:59.392
