00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.527
There were going to be a drone

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:00.960
launch site.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:01.261
Right now,

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.729
it's obviously extremely dangerous

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:03.630
and we have to watch out that the

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:04.431
Russians don't see us

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.835
speed and precision are essential.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:09.469
The drone,

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:11.504
a Quadro copter on steroids,

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:15.375
able to carry a massive payload up to £45

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.544
In this case, a mortar shell.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:18.445
The Ukrainian say

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:19.479
they got from retreating

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:21.181
Russian forces elsewhere

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:23.716
and are now using to hit Putin's army.

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:27.287
Now we finish our preparing

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:30.323
and one is ready

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:31.591
and we ready to go.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:32.192
Okay.

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:35.161
Is it the ready?

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.729
Steady little

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:40.800
It's big.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.801
It's loud.

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.203
And it's heading straight

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:45.238
to the Russian position.

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.907
We need to hide out here.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:50.243
The hunters quickly become the hunted.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.278
So for the Russians,

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:53.313
the drone crews are also

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:54.414
a high value target.

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:54.781
So obviously,

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:55.915
the Russians want nothing more

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:57.650
than to kill these guys.

00:01:58.051 --> 00:01:59.786
Unfazed by the shelling around us,

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:00.286
the pilot

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.855
