00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:09.829
So you just dropped the bomb?

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:10.363
Yeah.

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:13.633
This is what the blast looks like

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:15.768
from the drones camera. Pitch black.

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:18.004
The strike fully automated.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:19.405
It's not until daytime

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:21.074
that a reconnaissance flight proves

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:23.076
