00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:23.843
Not clear

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:25.111
how many Russians were killed

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:27.180
and wounded here. Said a wall.

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.082
This will allow the defense forces

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:31.217
of Ukraine to move forward and continue

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:31.818
the offensive,

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:32.418
he says,

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:34.320
with minimal losses will inflict

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.122
maximum losses on the enemy.

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:38.491
For the victory of Ukraine.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:39.692
But it's not over.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.294
As the UAV flies back,

00:02:41.294 --> 00:02:43.429
intercepted text messages show

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:45.331
the Russians have heard the drone

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:47.700
and are targeting

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.970
enemy bird spotted a Russian texts

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:51.704
understood.

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:53.573
Another answers

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.376
they launch flares to spot the drone.

00:02:56.376 --> 00:02:57.410
Now you can see

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:01.314
effect their cluster called lose track

00:03:02.215 --> 00:03:03.716
or they shoot him as up to see the drone

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:05.351
or why they cannot see the drone.

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:08.655
But they should for this

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:10.023
Finally,

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:12.759
the drone makes it back.

00:03:13.159 --> 00:03:15.161
They need to get out of here fast.

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:17.864
And we follow you. Yeah. Let's go

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:18.631
Don't go on.

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:19.399
After what they say

00:03:19.399 --> 00:03:20.867
was a successful mission.

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:21.868
The drone warriors

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.903
leave exactly the way they came

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:28.775
And Fred joins me now from Zapier.

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:31.911
Fred, what extraordinary footage.

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:34.847
What a remarkable vantage point you had.

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:36.749
Obviously, what this drone unit does

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.685
is extremely dangerous.

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:41.321
Have they taken a lot of losses

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:43.389
either, John, yet?

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:44.190
Well, certainly

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.225
it is extremely dangerous.

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:45.658
And, you know,

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:46.993
special teams like this,

00:03:46.993 --> 00:03:48.461
they've used the cover of darkness.

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:48.895
They move in.

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:50.129
They've really stealthy way,

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:52.165
but they also are extremely vulnerable

00:03:52.165 --> 00:03:53.132
if they get discovered

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:54.434
and taken under fire.

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:55.768
And, you know, these drone units

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:57.136
are extremely high value

00:03:57.136 --> 00:03:58.404
targets for the Russians.

00:03:58.404 --> 00:03:59.806
And the guys told us if the Russians

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:00.373
