00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:06.646
And I asked the unit about this

00:04:06.646 --> 00:04:07.013
and they said,

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:08.214
of course, it's happened to them

00:04:08.214 --> 00:04:08.615
