00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:13.620
No one has been killed so far.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:14.520
They obviously say

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.688
they want to keep it that way,

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:16.456
but they also say

00:04:16.456 --> 00:04:18.358
they certainly are not going to back down

00:04:18.358 --> 00:04:18.858
from the missions

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:20.193
that they're currently conducting John.

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:22.061
How high tech, Fred,

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:24.564
