00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:47.820
All of that is automated.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.522
And it was quite surprising to us

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:50.857
that that it works that well.

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:52.592
So it is pretty high tech.

00:04:52.592 --> 00:04:53.493
They are able to hit

00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:54.494
extremely accurately.

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:55.628
And they say, John,

00:04:55.628 --> 00:04:57.563
