00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.182
Yeah, it was it was it was a mortar,

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:18.751
122 millimeter mortar that they found

00:05:18.918 --> 00:05:19.652
from the Russians

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:20.720
