00:05:25.258 --> 00:05:26.793
And the Ukrainians were essentially

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:27.860
joking and saying, look,

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.029
we're giving them back there. Ammunition.

00:05:30.029 --> 00:05:30.897
They use that.

00:05:30.897 --> 00:05:33.032
And then they they basically rigged that

00:05:33.032 --> 00:05:35.134
