00:05:40.807 --> 00:05:42.342
as well, that with something

00:05:42.342 --> 00:05:44.043
that's seen this rudimentary like that,

00:05:44.043 --> 00:05:45.211
they were able to conduct

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:46.212
a precision strike.

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:47.613
They did show us later

00:05:47.613 --> 00:05:48.648
when they had a reconnaissance

00:05:48.648 --> 00:05:49.682
flight a day later

00:05:49.682 --> 00:05:51.017
that they very accurately hit

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:52.085
that target John.

00:05:52.085 --> 00:05:54.120
It all surprised me, Fred, frankly,

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.154
nothing more than the fact

00:05:55.154 --> 00:05:56.589
